# Raz checks D.Ai after each login and every day, and tells the week once a week (docs/RAZ.md §14).
[Unit]
Description=Raz: D.Ai checks itself
Documentation=https://github.com/diamondrubinny/D.Ai/blob/main/docs/RAZ.md

[Service]
Type=oneshot
Nice=15
IOSchedulingClass=idle
ExecStart=-/usr/bin/dai-raz check --quiet
ExecStart=/usr/bin/dai-raz week --notify --weekly
